{"about_the_game":"Based on the novel &quot;El Collar de Sangre&quot; by German Ramos Bri\u00f1ez, The Necklace of Blood is a two parts thriller visual novel.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe necklace of blood is a jewel which many would give their lives for,  they don\u2019t imagine the power and responsibility of owning it. The necklace has been cursed and bathed in the blood of Satan himself, the necklace was consecrated on the altars of death to cause the madness of men.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe evil one has sent a powerful Jackal to this dimension, his son, to be confused among men.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe mission of the Jackal is to enforce a prophecy written more than 200 years ago, which points to the moral and religious destruction of a great metropolis, New York.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo fulfill the objective, the Jackal recruits men, in different ways, and turns them into vassals at the service of darkness, to spread the plague.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn old secret organization, called &quot;The Council&quot;, fights against the power of the Devil, and tries by all means to end the word of evil, written in black books.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is the story of one of those men, manipulated by the black light of death, which induces him to become a vassal and commits him to the ultimate consequences.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt is a journey that will take emotions to the limit and make you reflect on the behavior of people in an environment dominated by vanity and consumerism, where moral values are a facade and ethics is a price as solid as personal convenience.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"56aa524c22a37053ca0c6bfdde2406db747effe5.jpg","localized_name":"The Blood Pact","name":"The Blood Pact","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/792760/56aa524c22a37053ca0c6bfdde2406db747effe5.jpg"},{"icon":"4900082edf8b095e6052e900ba49455606a7e2ce.jpg","localized_name":"Mortal Ambition","name":"Mortal Ambition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati